  ORDERING IS THE CONTRACT (#243): the stable blocks — identical for every
  lane, every wave, every sprint — render FIRST so N teammate prompts share
  the longest possible byte prefix; per-lane/per-session variables render
  LAST. Do not move a variable above the stable region.

  Complete-context template: every variable below is REQUIRED (StrictUndefined).
  Optionals are passed as null/[] by the renderer, never omitted.

  LEDGER CUSTODY CONTRACT (#261): `run_dir` MUST be the ABSOLUTE path to the
